{
  "key": 42023,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello!\r",
        "Karate King, the Fighting Dojo’s\n",
        "master, is in a cave in Johto for\f",
        "further training."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello!\r",
        "We are letting the Gym Leaders use the\n",
        "Dojo while the Karate King is away.\r",
        "You can give them a call when you\n",
        "register their numbers.\r",
        "They say they are happy to accept\n",
        "your challenge as long as they are\f",
        "not busy."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00002",
      "en_US": "“Struggle for vengeance”"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00003",
      "en_US": "“A complicated fracture”"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Falkner: Hi! I’ve been waiting for you!\r",
        "It’s a pleasure to be able to battle\n",
        "you again!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Falkner: Mmm...\n",
        "It’s still a long way to become\f",
        "the best Trainer..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Bugsy: Good to see you again!\r",
        "Behold my bug research!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Bugsy: You must have studied\n",
        "a lot about Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Whitney: I never break my promises!\n",
        "Are you ready?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Whitney: You really are strong!\n",
        "But I won’t lose next time!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Chuck: There you are!\r",
        "Taste my 24-hour training!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Chuck: Wahaha!\n",
        "A battle with you is never boring!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: We’re here as we promised...\n",
        "Are you prepared?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00013",
      "en_US": "Jasmine: True to your reputation..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Morty: I was just talking about you...\n",
        "Let’s battle!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Morty: I’ve lost again...\r",
        "You may have something more than\n",
        "just strength."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Pryce: Finally.\r",
        "No need for words.\n",
        "A Pokémon battle is the way for us\f",
        "to communicate.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Pryce: Mmm...\n",
        "Impressive!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Clair: ...You are here.\n",
        "Now let’s battle!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Clair: Way to go.\n",
        "...\f",
        "Now give it your all!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Hey!\n",
        "The promise we made!\f",
        "Let’s battle again!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Oh no!\n",
        "You are very strong!\f",
        "But I will repay my debt someday."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: I knew you’d come!\n",
        "I had a feeling.\r",
        "What? We promised each other,\n",
        "so it’s no surprise?\r",
        "...Well, you may be right.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: I know...you will give me a call\n",
        "again sometime."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: How are you?\n",
        "Good to see you again!\r",
        "This place really doesn’t suit me,\f",
        "but...let’s ignore that and battle!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00025",
      "en_US": "Erika: You have grown even stronger..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: So here you are...\n",
        "Don’t make me wait!\r",
        "I’ve heard a lot of good things\n",
        "about you since our last battle.\r",
        "Let me test how good you are!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Wow!\n",
        "You are getting stronger by\f",
        "the battle!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: All right!\n",
        "Time to fulfill our promise!\f",
        "Let’s have a Pokémon battle!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: I’ve lost again...\n",
        "You aren’t adventuring around\f",
        "for nothing!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "Janine: I can’t use my ninja technique,\n",
        "but I won’t let you win!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "Janine: I lost today,\n",
        "but I’ll win next time!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: You keep your word.\n",
        "That’s a good thing, kiddo!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00033",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Waaah!\r",
        "If I had known this Dojo was going to be\n",
        "available, I wouldn’t have needed to\f",
        "rebuild my Gym.\r",
        "Wait! I still did, didn’t I?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "Blue: Good!\n",
        "Thanks for coming to lose to me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0533_T11R0101_00035",
      "en_US": [
        "Blue: Hahaha!\n",
        "My scare tactic doesn’t scare you\f",
        "at all!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
